    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d761">

                <pb facs="0616" n="500" sameAs="frus:frus1914/pg500"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 812.00/12003.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Spanish Ambassador to the Secretary of State.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Spanish Embassy</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1914-05-17">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">May 17, 1914</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Mr. Secretary</hi>: The representatives of General
                    Huerta delegated to represent him at the conference called through the mediation
                    of Brazil, Argentina and Chile asked me, on their leaving to-day for New York
                    and Niagara Falls, to present in their names to your excellency their earnest
                    thanks for all the attentions and courtesies extended to them since their
                    arrival on American territory by your excellency and the Department of State,
                    which attentions and courtesies they have appreciated to their full value.</p>
                <p>In discharging this very pleasant duty, I avail [etc.]</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Juan Riaño</hi></signed>.</closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
